  "labels": [],
  "notes": "Server done: sync/bulk leave stored rows alone on rule change; preview/apply/revert ops; docs/decisions.md section; tests rename-rules-forward.test.ts. api 1799 pass 0 fail 0 skip.\nReview fixes B1-B4 + F1/F2/F6; api 1823 pass 0 fail.\nlanded outside tk close at e597970 (branch tk/budget-ou8p merged into main by hand)\nMerged to local main (not pushed); owner approved in the Inbox thread 'Transfers refactor' on 2026-11-25. A rule add/edit/remove no longer changes stored rows (sync compares the bank text, recorded in connection_transactions.bank_text; /bulk recognises rows by amount, date and text); preview/apply/revert of one rule to past rows, server-recorded (0122), not on MCP; shared advisory lock for sync, exclusive for apply/revert with a 5 s lock_timeout. Three independent reviews attached; orchestrator read the last round and reran on 6bd2863: api tsc and eslint clean, shared 222, full api 1834 pass / 0 fail.",
